  {
   "id": "reynatis-287858@post-2025-02-01",
   "gameId": "reynatis-287858",
   "displayName": "Chapter 24 if: Ukai, Strategic Prodigy is now available!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2025-02-01T18:00:11.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "REYNATIS is a full-blown action-packed magical RPG in which two people with different perspectives fight for their ideals in a realistic recreation of modern-day Shibuya, Tokyo. The seventh free update just came in!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chapter 24 if: Ukai, Strategic Prodigy",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Watching Moa receive the chalice from Makabe, Ukai feels complex emotions stirring in his heart.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "These mixed feelings prompt Ukai to begin telling the story of events from his past.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Why did he become afraid of appearing in public? Why does he refuse to take on responsibility? And what is the true nature of the nightmare that continues to torment Ukai?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* The screenshot is from the Japanese version.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "+ Wishlist today and stay tuned for upcoming news, including content updates!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* The content update schedule may be subject to change without notice.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
